# Cross-origin isolation, which is what lets the page construct the
# *shared* WebAssembly.Memory the emulator module imports (the DS
# engine's C++ comes out of the threads sysroot — see build.sh).
# Cloudflare Pages reads this file; the local dev server (serve.py)
# sends the same two headers.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
